  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>To find domain we will take following cases:</p><p>Case-1:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Case-2:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Case-3:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Case-4:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>case&#160;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>case&#160;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>case&#160;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>case&#160;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
